    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jim Gallagher of Corry Estates is thrilled to welcome 5 Edenmore Avenue to the market for sale - an excellent 3 bedroom mid-terrace home, with the benefit of a rear garden, and off-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1960's, this fine property extends to approx. 91 sq m / 980 sq ft of well laid out living and bedroom accommodation. Comprising in brief an entrance hall, living room, dining room, kitchen, and bathroom all located downstairs, while upstairs there are 3 bedrooms. To the front is a gated driveway providing off-street parking, and to the rear is a mature garden laid in lawn, and a garden shed.\r\n\r\nLocated just off the Spingdale Road, the location is excellent. The 27a bus stop is less than 100m from the house, with other bus routes being in very close proximity. There are numerous schools in the area, as well as sporting and recreational amenities. Beaumont Hospital, Dublin Airport, and Clarehall Shopping Centre are all nearby, and the M1/M50 interchange is just a short drive opening up the wider city and further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch: spacious tiled porch\r\n\r\nHall: with wooden floor and under stair storage\r\n\r\nLiving Room: located to the front of the house, with wooden flooring and fireplace\r\n\r\nDining Room: large space with wooden floor and ample room for dining\r\n\r\nKitchen: with tiled floor, fitted with an array of built-in units at eye and counter level, with integrated double oven, hob, and plumbed for washing machine\r\n\r\nBathroom: walk-in shower, W.C., and wash hand basin with storage\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: large double bedroom located to the front of the house, with built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: double bedroom to the rear, with wooden flooring and built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: generous single bedroom overlooking the rear garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Gas Fired Central Heating\r\n- Rear Garden\r\n- Off-Street Parking"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
    ],
